]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Home_Ladder.Basic_Index.Index,60)MOV(0,Home_Ladder.Read_Back_Active_Home_Values.Offset)SSV(AXIS,Servo_Drive,HomeOffset,Home_Ladder.Active_Home_Set.Offset)MOV(70,Home_Ladder.Basic_Index.Index);]]>
</Text>
