<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Home_Ladder.Basic_Index.Index,70)XIO(Servo_Drive.ConfigUpdateInProcess)GSV(AXIS,Servo_Drive,HomeOffset,Home_Ladder.Read_Back_Active_Home_Values.Offset)EQU(Home_Ladder.Active_Home_Set.Offset,Home_Ladder.Read_Back_Active_Home_Values.Offset)MOV(80,Home_Ladder.Basic_Index.Index);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Sequence

Select the event that will cause the Home Position to be set:

Sequence Type	Description
Immediate (0) = Sets the Home Position to the present actual position, without motion.
Switch (1) = Sets the Home Position when axis motion encounters a home limit switch.
Marker (2)  = Sets the Home Position when axis encounters an encoder marker.
Switch-Marker (3) = Sets the Home Position when axis first encounters a home limit switch, then encounters an encoder marker.
 
]]>
</Comment>
